    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBuilt in 2020, Chestnut Hill is located near the Whitford House Hotel and therefore has easy access to the N25. While a small private estate of some 46 homes, such services as the Clonard Retail Parks, local shops and national and secondary schools are within easy reach, and there is also a local bus service into Wexford Town.All the homes in this exclusive estate are detached with off-street parking, side gates, patio areas and air-to-water heating.No. 21 is 154 sqm and boasts a private living room to the front, L shaped kitchen/dining area to the back that flows into the second living room making this a wonderful family room. Upstairs are the family bathroom with shower and bath separate, along with four generous bedrooms - the main bedroom has an en-suite and walk in wardrobe and two of the other bedrooms have fitted triple wardrobes.If you are looking for an A rated family home in a private exclusive estate, with easy access to primary roads as well as local amenities, No. 21 Chestnut Hill should be on your viewing list."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3m x 1.6m and 4.1m x 1.9m\nwith tiled flooring and wainscotting, small storage under the stairs\n\nLiving Room - 3.7m x 3.4m\nwith carpet flooring, electric fire in feature wall, shelving in alcoves\n\nKitchen/Dining into Living Room - 7m x 3.9m and 5.1m x 3.8m\ndouble aspect room with herringbone flooring throughout and island unit in kitchen area. Feature wall in living area with lots of storage. Sliding patio doors to the rear patio.\n\nUtility Room - 2.4m x 1m\nwith same herringbone flooring, lots of storage and rear door access\n\nGuest WC off utility - 1.7m x 1.5m\nwith tiled floor, WC and WHB\n\nLanding Return - 1.9m x 0.8m\nwith 3.5m high window\n\nLanding - 2.8m x 2.5m\nwith carpet\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.2m\nrear facing room with carpet and triple wardrobe\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 2.1m\nwith tiled floor, bath and shower surround. WC, WHB in floating vanity unit, bath and separate shower unit\n\nStorage/Hot Press - 0.9m x 0.45m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.5m x 3.3m\nrear facing room with carpet and triple wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.2m x 2.8m\nfront facing room with carpet\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.7m x 3.4m\nfront facing room with carpet, walk in wardrobe and en-suite\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 2m x 1.3m\nwith hanging areas and shelving\n\nEn-Suite - 2.5m x 1.4m\nwith tiled flooring and shower surround, WC, WHB in floating vanity unit and shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
