        "Content": "<ul><li>154sqm detached home</li><li>Built 2020, A rated BER</li><li>Private living room to the front</li><li>L shaped kitchen/dining/ living area</li><li>Utility and guest WC on ground floor</li><li>Four bedrooms, main with en-suite and walk in wardrobe</li><li>East facing patio to the rear</li><li>Off-street parking</li><li>Mains services, air to water heating</ul>"
